{"hymn":"FR135","parent":"E744","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":2},"title":"Pour en tout temps venir à Dieu","subtitle":"","syl":{"n1":"Pour","n2":"en","n3":"tout","n4":"temps","n5":["ve","i"],"n6":["nir","t"],"n7":"à","n8":"Dieu,","n9":"Un","n10":"cœur","n11":"pur","n12":"est","n13":["pré","i"],"n14":["cieux,","t"],"n15":"Pour","n16":"qu'à","n17":"nous","n18":["tou","i"],"n19":["tes","t"],"n20":"Ses","n21":["ri","i"],"n22":["chesses,","t"],"n23":["Soi","i"],"n24":["ent‿don","m"],"n25":["né‿es,","t"],"n26":"dans","n27":"Sa","n28":"grâce."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Change mon cœur qui n'est pas droit,","Éclaire mes pensées,","Pour discerner Tes intentions,","Saisir Ta volonté."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Seigneur, Tu veux un cœur fervent,","Un cœur brulant d'amour,","Pour Toi, rempli de sentiments,","Désirant Ton retour."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Tu veux un cœur obéissant :","Soumets ma volonté,","Adoucis-là, mais rends-moi fort,","Pour Ton plan, Bien-aimé !"]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Mon cœur ne doit pas mépriser,","Mais en tout chercher Dieu.","Et la conscience est purifiée,","Par le sang si précieux."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["En moi, Seigneur, mets un tel cœur,","Toujours tourné vers Toi !","Pour y graver Ta sainteté","Et T'exprimer par moi !"]}]}